  "title": "Change the Escape Success Rate [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "逃走成功率を変更する【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "6c8615e244b1469eecba862aec584f07f6c96f3f2ce570043a0e7c9c9460b289",
      "translation": "Change the Escape Success Rate [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "6c8615e244b1469eecba862aec584f07f6c96f3f2ce570043a0e7c9c9460b289"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "逃走成功率の計算式を変更します。",
      "sourceHash": "397c68ca91b221a550a096a7599aaa8b6079c9d355a2b8cd6163ba72558c9151",
      "translation": "Changes the formula used to calculate the escape success rate.",
      "contextHash": "397c68ca91b221a550a096a7599aaa8b6079c9d355a2b8cd6163ba72558c9151"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-001",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "運やレベルでの計算に変更可能",
      "sourceHash": "b747442d0f18c58c4b07e4575c7a3439cadd192a930d67112926b66461a25fe3",
      "translation": "Can be changed to use luck or level for the calculation",
      "contextHash": "b747442d0f18c58c4b07e4575c7a3439cadd192a930d67112926b66461a25fe3"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-002",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "最低逃走率を設定可能",
      "sourceHash": "dfba73356a6df5497b4ce0c46d04173463c126dbd75c413583cc72b2482825d2",
      "translation": "Can set the minimum escape rate",
      "contextHash": "dfba73356a6df5497b4ce0c46d04173463c126dbd75c413583cc72b2482825d2"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-003",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "逃走失敗時の補正を変更可能",
      "sourceHash": "e3f134026434248ede242e55c9ea8fad91b63260c5d507995a0299563d45203a",
      "translation": "Can change the bonus applied when escape fails",
      "contextHash": "e3f134026434248ede242e55c9ea8fad91b63260c5d507995a0299563d45203a"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-004",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "逃走に成功しやすくなる特徴を設定可能",
      "sourceHash": "93b1d45edcfc1d808a654d31be9d7a063c6a4e8de1c79a0093e3a01da123ed61",
      "translation": "Can set traits that make escape more likely",
      "contextHash": "93b1d45edcfc1d808a654d31be9d7a063c6a4e8de1c79a0093e3a01da123ed61"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のリンクを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d",
      "translation": "Right-click the link below to save it, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn the feature ON from the RPG Maker plugin manager.",
      "contextHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＶ、ＭＺの両方で有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5",
      "translation": "※This plugin works with both MV and MZ.",
      "contextHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-001",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NRP_EscapeRatio.js",
      "sourceHash": "2bed0e720efb10073a8abb30ec58e974147c9c4daca37c505c9ab7c4a4ef7a43",
      "translation": "NRP_EscapeRatio.js ",
      "contextHash": "7d4300862b98f39fa868fd1f8a957c758da7ebf65eae8b79f19a1d209f33ade4"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ver1.00（2023/07/31）",
      "sourceHash": "c367255bd3853e4dd56188d39105487b584967e32d54cf52a9d8c34819641d7b",
      "translation": "ver1.00 (2023/07/31) ",
      "contextHash": "7d4300862b98f39fa868fd1f8a957c758da7ebf65eae8b79f19a1d209f33ade4"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-003",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "更新履歴（History）",
      "sourceHash": "5f6734086058838026416575c635cfc7e1074ad8b8757438df171ba1ac7963c7",
      "translation": "Update History (History)",
      "contextHash": "5f6734086058838026416575c635cfc7e1074ad8b8757438df171ba1ac7963c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-004",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "2023/07/31（ver1.00）",
      "sourceHash": "57c752d234cd11802c93e52dfd497d58078e8b1e249f4f983b084408f478f1df",
      "translation": "2023/07/31 (ver1.00) ",
      "contextHash": "57c752d234cd11802c93e52dfd497d58078e8b1e249f4f983b084408f478f1df"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-005",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "公開！",
      "sourceHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664",
      "translation": "Released!",
      "contextHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "既定の計算式",
      "sourceHash": "dc77a8eabbf0567741c7cb259bfb03e8ef53cef44dac175a3673f02f72df7296",
      "translation": "Default Formula",
      "contextHash": "dc77a8eabbf0567741c7cb259bfb03e8ef53cef44dac175a3673f02f72df7296"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "前提として、ツクールＭＺの逃走成功率は以下の通りです。",
      "sourceHash": "b5decfa24b2947103128a2e851ac10641f60cf46f9caae2fe474f361787aabb2",
      "translation": "First, the escape success rate in RPG Maker MZ is as follows.",
      "contextHash": "b5decfa24b2947103128a2e851ac10641f60cf46f9caae2fe474f361787aabb2"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-001",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "逃走成功率 = (0.5 * $gameParty.agility()) / $gameTroop.agility()",
      "sourceHash": "5428ad77512303be436328bc7f50053815385cec8d57a828339024485b5026d3",
      "translation": "Escape success rate = (0.5 * $gameParty.agility()) / $gameTroop.agility()",
      "contextHash": "5428ad77512303be436328bc7f50053815385cec8d57a828339024485b5026d3"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "意味は『(0.5 &times; 味方の敏捷性の平均値) / 敵の敏捷性の平均値』となります。",
      "sourceHash": "a7ea59808e01f0a51babca1afdb1d382c296616f615fff30e43029f8f8cf0a0b",
      "translation": "This means “(0.5 &times; average agility of allies) / average agility of enemies.”",
      "contextHash": "a7ea59808e01f0a51babca1afdb1d382c296616f615fff30e43029f8f8cf0a0b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "例えば、以下のようになります。",
      "sourceHash": "20a12d4ac9470b960211b068614e469a8944d8b5b27542e73142e2ea98ccfa15",
      "translation": "For example, it works as follows.",
      "contextHash": "20a12d4ac9470b960211b068614e469a8944d8b5b27542e73142e2ea98ccfa15"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-006",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "味方の敏捷性と敵の敏捷性が等しい場合は確率５０％。",
      "sourceHash": "1860c2827716acb495902f0406b576ff7cd1370f0fd228d45d57a10fc5a661c5",
      "translation": "When the allies’ and enemies’ agility are equal, the rate is 50%.",
      "contextHash": "1860c2827716acb495902f0406b576ff7cd1370f0fd228d45d57a10fc5a661c5"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-007",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "味方の敏捷性が敵の敏捷性のニ倍の場合は確率１００％。",
      "sourceHash": "bfd0356888725fa791e3b643443b12b0ffe48fe0ef41188f85041d8b0c7f92ed",
      "translation": "When the allies’ agility is twice the enemies’ agility, the rate is 100%.",
      "contextHash": "bfd0356888725fa791e3b643443b12b0ffe48fe0ef41188f85041d8b0c7f92ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "さらに逃走に失敗する度に成功率が＋１０％されます。",
      "sourceHash": "a0ae600ef97b1696a6c8c6a036b09b7ebbfa672777e6b015c11ff7217e664a06",
      "translation": "Additionally, the success rate increases by +10% each time escape fails.",
      "contextHash": "a0ae600ef97b1696a6c8c6a036b09b7ebbfa672777e6b015c11ff7217e664a06"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "計算式の変更",
      "sourceHash": "e9a1403cbbcfc51119a32b2ce85ab0a9f3cfcaf710b18c0304404713dfbf6430",
      "translation": "Changing the Formula",
      "contextHash": "e9a1403cbbcfc51119a32b2ce85ab0a9f3cfcaf710b18c0304404713dfbf6430"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "上記を参考にプラグインパラメータの『逃走計算式』を変更してください。",
      "sourceHash": "6ba96f7c7950280566afb9aa4a5536a60217f5523e8e9f381e352b5f4c8b1f10",
      "translation": "Using the above as a reference, change the “Escape Formula” plugin parameter.",
      "contextHash": "6ba96f7c7950280566afb9aa4a5536a60217f5523e8e9f381e352b5f4c8b1f10"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "また、当プラグインの機能により、以下のパラメータを計算に使用できます。",
      "sourceHash": "e7684ac2958ae87551964363f3e2a30c58afe599a3d9cb42de14679e0ef7977b",
      "translation": "This plugin also allows the following parameters to be used in calculations.",
      "contextHash": "e7684ac2958ae87551964363f3e2a30c58afe599a3d9cb42de14679e0ef7977b"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "運の平均値",
      "sourceHash": "01d4d94c88cb446db99e3fcfc7cf26122ed30f14922a959ebfec117f71d9ebc5",
      "translation": "Average Luck",
      "contextHash": "01d4d94c88cb446db99e3fcfc7cf26122ed30f14922a959ebfec117f71d9ebc5"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "レベルの平均値",
      "sourceHash": "92a19220b2cef27fcffc909de632807069891344adb4055df698689e367ba1b5",
      "translation": "Average Level",
      "contextHash": "92a19220b2cef27fcffc909de632807069891344adb4055df698689e367ba1b5"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "敏捷性の最大値",
      "sourceHash": "429e4a8fa2f22a19270afa99b1620baad83c3a207361baafe79ea19826b60f58",
      "translation": "Maximum Agility",
      "contextHash": "429e4a8fa2f22a19270afa99b1620baad83c3a207361baafe79ea19826b60f58"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "運の最大値",
      "sourceHash": "737290262db51e2fbb4f0251dc91cba8dd0605016d4baf1281b5f2e5d52ca4c1",
      "translation": "Maximum Luck",
      "contextHash": "737290262db51e2fbb4f0251dc91cba8dd0605016d4baf1281b5f2e5d52ca4c1"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-011",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "レベルの最大値",
      "sourceHash": "3b94991c784f73e19c1a46aac8ff81b4c43d1cc4895f138c0b8b59b5f23fa9ef",
      "translation": "Maximum Level",
      "contextHash": "3b94991c784f73e19c1a46aac8ff81b4c43d1cc4895f138c0b8b59b5f23fa9ef"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "対応しているのは敏捷性と運とレベルだけです。",
      "sourceHash": "97942393e1fdd34669f8c1291f6c20ba3e0cac90586a31f5ba8f7577f845cf82",
      "translation": "Only agility, luck, and level are supported.",
      "contextHash": "97942393e1fdd34669f8c1291f6c20ba3e0cac90586a31f5ba8f7577f845cf82"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "敵のレベルは標準では存在しないため、必要ならば外部プラグインで設定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "95aa0242df34fecc1065edf2f8485091cca6d38780d58746ea67a456796b0094",
      "translation": "Since enemies do not have levels by default, set them using an external plugin if necessary.",
      "contextHash": "95aa0242df34fecc1065edf2f8485091cca6d38780d58746ea67a456796b0094"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-012",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "アクター、職業、装備、ステート、スキルのメモ欄",
      "sourceHash": "f0d96612722e17dac0cca9a1860cf48b34631b2c686ad3e91d2efb23bb113d9b",
      "translation": "Note Fields for Actors, Classes, Equipment, States, and Skills",
      "contextHash": "f0d96612722e17dac0cca9a1860cf48b34631b2c686ad3e91d2efb23bb113d9b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下を記入すれば、逃走成功率が上昇する特徴を作成できます。",
      "sourceHash": "a146d3fcbf61b55bcd236c9d217e8f222e1a29119d1c0f650b06080695690043",
      "translation": "You can create a trait that increases the escape success rate by entering the following.",
      "contextHash": "a146d3fcbf61b55bcd236c9d217e8f222e1a29119d1c0f650b06080695690043"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "スキルについては、習得しているだけで効果が発生します。",
      "sourceHash": "3b7886e2ea3408b24a2cb18c789827ce1c6c6eb5065156459e524b0e0d4604f6",
      "translation": "For skills, the effect is applied simply by learning the skill.",
      "contextHash": "3b7886e2ea3408b24a2cb18c789827ce1c6c6eb5065156459e524b0e0d4604f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-015",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "逃走成功率が10%上昇します。",
      "sourceHash": "57b331796d7ac404d21345968a894165def3d5a070e7159868905403d693fb11",
      "translation": "The escape success rate increases by 10%.",
      "contextHash": "57b331796d7ac404d21345968a894165def3d5a070e7159868905403d693fb11"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-016",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、効果は重複します。",
      "sourceHash": "237fa4b1fd35c6194b48ea601daab38bce3b6e02f8cb5ec7ea1e0fe2f5c75bf2",
      "translation": "The effects stack.",
      "contextHash": "237fa4b1fd35c6194b48ea601daab38bce3b6e02f8cb5ec7ea1e0fe2f5c75bf2"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-013",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameters）",
      "sourceHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Plugin Parameters)",
      "contextHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-014",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "逃走計算式（EscapeFormula）",
      "sourceHash": "b370c98f994b6cc176985231b4e65e7878bfe2de31b0c8f3f1e0a58dad17cc43",
      "translation": "Escape Formula (EscapeFormula)",
      "contextHash": "b370c98f994b6cc176985231b4e65e7878bfe2de31b0c8f3f1e0a58dad17cc43"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-017",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "逃走率を決める計算式です。",
      "sourceHash": "4518e7898d2f54c06c2e81e21e512f1b3b7d6e49cda52ae8b12490af04342142",
      "translation": "This is the formula used to determine the escape rate.",
      "contextHash": "4518e7898d2f54c06c2e81e21e512f1b3b7d6e49cda52ae8b12490af04342142"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-018",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "既定値：(0.5 * 味方の敏捷性の平均) / 敵の敏捷性の平均",
      "sourceHash": "dd2e8ad33c4f0b9dbf1a7eac3f31b76f173e92b78c499bba0011dd8a0d1e70b9",
      "translation": "Default: (0.5 * average agility of allies) / average agility of enemies",
      "contextHash": "dd2e8ad33c4f0b9dbf1a7eac3f31b76f173e92b78c499bba0011dd8a0d1e70b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-015",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "逃走失敗時のボーナス（EscapeFailBonus）",
      "sourceHash": "08965327562c8d143d4087c6e8878280d4f19c77fcf972c877522abc26a0ae02",
      "translation": "Escape Failure Bonus (EscapeFailBonus)",
      "contextHash": "08965327562c8d143d4087c6e8878280d4f19c77fcf972c877522abc26a0ae02"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-019",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "逃走失敗時、次の成功率が指定数値分だけ上昇します。",
      "sourceHash": "86eb2c30fc011bc46dfb6357cf3fa2e7211fd29a1818ee716589e2b53afc391d",
      "translation": "When escape fails, the next success rate increases by the specified amount.",
      "contextHash": "86eb2c30fc011bc46dfb6357cf3fa2e7211fd29a1818ee716589e2b53afc391d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-020",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "初期値は0.1（10%）です。",
      "sourceHash": "c2c0a1806d08ff31c503e984234fce673d272b111a4a6af125381302deff3990",
      "translation": "The initial value is 0.1 (10%).",
      "contextHash": "c2c0a1806d08ff31c503e984234fce673d272b111a4a6af125381302deff3990"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-016",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "最低逃走率（EscapeMinRate）",
      "sourceHash": "6731caf63209157cd46130a3f760819c741f61f7eabc3ec81a074573bfda1ab0",
      "translation": "Minimum Escape Rate (EscapeMinRate)",
      "contextHash": "6731caf63209157cd46130a3f760819c741f61f7eabc3ec81a074573bfda1ab0"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-021",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "最低限保証される逃走率です。",
      "sourceHash": "4f6fc99442b5ebb1e9e26b41add0a3229c1d2e777a69f82b6fb610366f60218d",
      "translation": "The minimum guaranteed escape rate.",
      "contextHash": "4f6fc99442b5ebb1e9e26b41add0a3229c1d2e777a69f82b6fb610366f60218d"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-017",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "生存者に限定（LimitAlive）",
      "sourceHash": "1b0cc8a88a0674b222c20ea1a375756dc9c53379ed581d795c3ed3f817ea4a5c",
      "translation": "Limit to Survivors (LimitAlive)",
      "contextHash": "1b0cc8a88a0674b222c20ea1a375756dc9c53379ed581d795c3ed3f817ea4a5c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-022",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "逃走率の計算を生存者の能力だけに限定します。",
      "sourceHash": "3d8c7e47ddc947fa52c16308454586c905473354ed852f529e7a3cafe1e4936d",
      "translation": "Limits escape rate calculations to the abilities of surviving allies.",
      "contextHash": "3d8c7e47ddc947fa52c16308454586c905473354ed852f529e7a3cafe1e4936d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-023",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、副作用により先制＆奇襲率の計算も生存者が対象になります。",
      "sourceHash": "02d21a987d3d2351e8fc1c963007aa3e35dcbc4fdce197248e7350411a5e2eea",
      "translation": "As a side effect, the calculations for preemptive attacks and surprise attacks also use only surviving allies.",
      "contextHash": "02d21a987d3d2351e8fc1c963007aa3e35dcbc4fdce197248e7350411a5e2eea"
    }
  ],
